○整数型: binarySearch(整数型の配列: data, 整数型: target)
  整数型: low, high, mid
  low ← 1  ⟦init⟧
  high ← dataの要素数  ⟦init⟧
  while (low ≦ high)  ⟦loop⟧
    mid ← (low + high) ÷ 2 の商  ⟦mid⟧
    if (data[mid] = target)  ⟦cmp⟧
      return mid  ⟦found⟧
    elseif (data[mid] < target)  ⟦lt⟧
      low ← mid + 1  ⟦right⟧
    else
      high ← mid - 1  ⟦left⟧
    endif
  endwhile
  return -1  ⟦notfound⟧
